// Title: OneDriveUpdater Executed from Non-Standard Location
// Description: Detects execution of OneDriveUpdater.exe from C:\ProgramData, which may represent a masqueraded binary attempting to impersonate legitimate Microsoft software.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1036.005, T1574
// Tactics: Defense Evasion, Persistence
// Platform: Microsoft Defender for Endpoint

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FileName =~ "OneDriveUpdater.exe"
| where FolderPath startswith @"C:\ProgramData"
